REVIEWS = [
 ("Matthew C.", "3 weeks ago", "We had a great time surfing with Troy! It was my 6 and 8 year old daughter’s first time surfing and I joined in as well. Troy was great with the kids, teaching the basics and ensuring everyone was prepped and comfortable before hitting the water. Once on the water he helped them paddle out, positioned the kids, and both caught multiple waves! Really fun experience for all and extremely satisfying as a parent to have a front row seat - we even caught a few waves together."),
 ("Farb M.", "a month ago", "I’ve really enjoyed working with Troy! He’s been incredibly helpful, professional, patient, and encouraging. Since I started taking lessons with him, I’ve become more and more motivated to learn surfing and improve every week.\n\nFor me, it’s become much more than just learning how to surf, it’s also a great full-body workout. I actually find myself exercising throughout the week so I can be stronger and better prepared for my weekend sessions with Troy!\n\nI really appreciate his teaching style. He’s professional and knowledgeable, but at the same time makes the whole experience relaxed and enjoyable. I also genuinely enjoy his company and our conversations while we’re out in the water waiting for the right wave.\n\nEvery session is something I look forward to. If you’re thinking about learning to surf or improving your skills, I definitely recommend Troy!"),
 ("Tom T.", "2 months ago", "I was referred to Troy from a good friend who grew up in Laguna Beach and is from a surfing family. He said Troy was the best, and based on that, I signed him up to teach our two grandsons to surf. My friend was proved right. Troy is the best! He had both of them up surfing on their first try and they continued to improve over the three lessons. They not only learned to surf, but Troy’s instruction inspired them to love it! I highly recommend Laguna Surf Lessons and Troy. We will be returning next summer!"),
 ("Efe A.", "2 months ago", "Had 2 lessons with Troy and it was a blast. (Obligatory “I had not done it before and I was able to stand after lesson 2” but fun is arguably more important.)\n\nBenefits of a private lesson: knowing which waves to take, personalized attention so that you are safer, continuous form evaluation.\n\nBenefits of doing it with Troy: timely, patient, knowledgeable, and fun to talk to. There are lull moments between sets, and you want the person you are on the water with to be a conversationalist. Troy is happy to talk about documentaries he has seen, along with general surfing knowledge, which I definitely appreciated."),
 ("Maximiliano A.", "2 months ago", "Troy was awesome. He had both our kids up and surfing way faster than we ever expected! They had an absolute blast and hands down said it was the most epic part of their vacation. 🌊🏄‍♂️🤙"),
 ("Sophia M.", "2 months ago", "We had an amazing surf lesson with Troy!!! He was patient, encouraging, and made us feel comfortable from the moment we got in the water. His instruction was clear and personalized and the lesson was so fun. Highly recommend whether you’re a beginner or more advanced and can’t wait to be back!!"),
 ("Andrea B.", "2 months ago", "Our family took lessons from Troy this past weekend, leaving us with lifelong memories! Our teenager stood up first wave and he gave our 7 year old the confidence to stand on her third wave. If you want a fun, encouraging, knowledgeable lesson, book with Troy!"),
 ("Karolina S.", "2 months ago", "Our lesson with Troy was perfect 👌🏻🤙🏻 He is a great teacher. Amazing experience, we absolutely recommend this surf school 😎"),
 ("Radomir", "2 months ago", "I tried surfing for the first time and it was awesome :) Don’t think twice, take lessons with Troy."),
 ("Marcin K.", "2 months ago", "It was a great time and good fun."),
 ("Divit S.", "3 months ago", "Had my first ever lesson with Troy and couldn't recommend the entire experience more to anyone thinking about it!\n\nTroy is a fantastic instructor with a wealth of experience in the ocean. Communication was clear and easy from the outset and I felt totally safe as a beginner out in the water. I will absolutely be coming back to Laguna for another surf session with Troy!"),
 ("Millie S.", "3 months ago", "Troy is an amazing surf instructor! He has such good knowledge of the ocean and really helped me! I caught nearly every wave and he was so encouraging. Such a lovely guy, definitely recommend him!! Millie from England"),
 ("Malika N.", "3 months ago", "We had a great experience surfing with Troy! He explained things clearly, was very supportive and made sure we had fun the whole time. I went with my younger sister who surfed for the first time and she really enjoyed it!"),
 ("Sp Y.", "3 months ago", "Five stars, hands down. Troy was patient from the first minute: clear instructions on the sand before we ever hit the water, and steady encouragement the whole way through. Caught my first wave quickly, which felt incredible. The whole lesson was genuinely fun. Troy was awesome. Lesson #2 happening soon. Highly recommend!"),
 ("Braxton F.", "4 months ago", "If I could give Troy 10 stars, I would! My wife Sammi and I decided on a whim to book a same-day surf lesson while celebrating our 5th anniversary, and Troy went completely above and beyond to accommodate us. Neither of us had ever been on a surfboard before, but Troy’s instruction was absolutely incredible. He was patient, knowledgeable, and broke everything down in a way that made us feel totally comfortable and safe out in the ocean. We were both actually catching waves and standing up way faster than we ever expected! The entire experience was so much fun and ended up being a massive highlight of our trip. If you are looking for top-tier instruction and an unforgettable time on the water, I cannot recommend Troy enough. Thank you for making our anniversary so special!"),
 ("Amy M.", "4 months ago", "Troy was so amazing with my triplet 8 year old boys! They were nervous to try surfing and by the end of the lesson they asked if we could do it again tomorrow. Troy made them so comfortable in the water and taught them about the ocean as well as how to surf. We can't wait to take more lessons!"),
 ("Jose I.", "4 months ago", "Great experience with Troy. Was a great teacher for my son who had gone surfing only once before. With Troy’s guidance he was able to catch a wave on his own and can stand up almost every time now."),
 ("Amir", "4 months ago", "Troy was awesome! Fantastic and patient instructor. He really made us feel confident and in control, even though this was our first time."),
 ("Carly F.", "4 months ago", "Had an epic first surfing lesson with Troy! Experienced, dependable and hands-on instructor for all skill levels. Highly recommend."),
 ("Jack", "6 months ago", "Troy is an incredible coach and human in general. I booked a private lesson for 3pm and he reached out right away to schedule for an hour later ensuring the best tide, surf, and overall experience. We had such a good time. He had us standing up by our first waves and was genuinely stoked to see us succeed. If you’re in Laguna, don’t waste your time looking for the best spot, this is it!!!"),
 ("David K.", "7 months ago", "I had an amazing first surfing experience with Troy in Laguna Beach! Surfing has been a lifelong dream of mine, and Troy made it come true. He was patient, encouraging, and an excellent instructor who made the whole session feel comfortable and fun.\n\nFrom the start, he explained everything clearly and helped me build confidence in the water. By the end of the session, I was actually riding waves, which felt incredible for my first time.\n\nIf you’re thinking about trying surfing for the first time or want to improve your skills, I can’t recommend Troy enough. I had a great session and can’t wait to get back out there and ride even more waves next time. 🌊🏄‍♂️"),
 ("Beatrice K.", "7 months ago", "Best gift to give! My husband had so much fun learning how to surf and got to check it off his bucket list. Troy is an amazing teacher: he’s easy going, patient, and passionate about what he does."),
 ("Jeff", "10 months ago", "Laguna Surf Lessons with Troy is a real 10/10! Troy was great with my son. He got him up on his feet, taught him about the ocean and how to read waves, and most importantly made him feel safe in the water. Troy even got some video of my son riding that was really the icing on the cake. Thanks Troy!!"),
 ("Phil D.", "a year ago", "I came in with absolutely zero surfing experience, but Troy had me standing up and riding waves in my very first lesson. Mind-blowing. His calm, encouraging teaching style and focus on safety made the experience not only informative, but also incredibly fun and relaxing!\n\nI’ve walked away from each of his lessons with new skills, more confidence, and a greater appreciation and respect for the ocean overall. Troy’s extensive surfing experience is priceless and his ability to connect with both adults and kids makes him an outstanding instructor!\n\nTroy is fantastic not only for beginners, but seasoned surfers that are looking to reach the next level. Thanks for helping me build confidence in the water, Troy. You rock!"),
 ("Rob R.", "a year ago", "Troy is an incredible surf instructor. I’ve taken two lessons with him now and am excited to keep going. He’s been surfing his whole life and knows the Laguna waves like the back of his hand. He teaches surfing in an easy to understand way and doesn’t overcomplicate it. When I’m out on the water with Troy, his calmness and great energy helped me feel comfortable in the water, and our lessons have done wonders for my confidence on the waves. He’s also teaching me to read the ocean and understand the waves that are coming. He’s not just going to get you up on a board, he’s going to make sure you have a great time doing it, and build the skills to be able to do it without an instructor. It’s awesome to find someone who isn’t just a good instructor, but is a great person who is fun to be around. I’m glad to have met Troy and highly recommend him to anyone looking for an awesome surf instructor in the Laguna area!"),
 ("Kim L.", "a year ago", "I hired Troy for a lesson for my teen daughter and her best friend, who are total beginners. Troy had such a fun and positive attitude, he clearly loves what he does. He was very patient, thorough, and encouraging as an instructor. Both of the girls were able to stand on their boards and catch a few waves during their lesson! I keep thinking about a sentence I heard him say: “As long as you're having fun, you're the best surfer out there!”"),
 ("Maggie Y.", "a year ago", "I had an amazing experience taking surf lessons in Laguna Beach! Coach Troy was super friendly, patient, and made it really easy to learn to surf, even as a first-timer. He breaks it down step by step so I was able to follow and not be overwhelmed. I was standing up on the board by the end of the lesson! The waves in Laguna Beach are ideal for beginners, and the scenery is absolutely stunning. Highly recommend to anyone looking to learn to surf or improve their skills while enjoying the best of Laguna Beach."),
 ("R F", "a year ago", "Troy is an awesome instructor: patient, clear, and just fun to be around. I was nervous at first, but he made it easy to relax and actually enjoy learning. Caught a few waves and had a great time. Definitely a memorable experience."),
 ("Lauren W.", "a year ago", "Our family of four spent two sessions with Troy and had a blast. He was super patient, encouraging and knowledgeable. All four of us caught multiple waves and we hope to come back and catch more with Troy!"),
 ("Yutong Z.", "a year ago", "Surfing with Troy is an amazing experience. He is skilled, professional, and he makes every lesson fun. Whether you’re a total beginner or just looking to level up, he’ll make sure you catch waves and have a blast doing it! 🌊🤙"),
 ("Brad M.", "a year ago", "Troy is the best. My family surfed with Troy in July and he took great care of us. I can't wait to book another lesson with him."),
 ("Paula L.", "a year ago", "My kid took a lesson with Troy. He’s patient, kind, trustworthy, and made sure my kid was safe. I would recommend him without hesitation."),
 ("Zachary W.", "a year ago", "Super personal and attentive instructor. Took a 1 on 1 private lesson with him and it was amazing. He just wants you to have fun and learn while doing so."),
]

